   "trade D+1 from D's close in the bias; target D's bias-side extreme, stop D's opposite extreme; no-room rows dropped; exit after 1380 trading M1 bars",
   "gate: D+1 is C3 or C4 (r<=2) vs C5+ (r>=3)"
  ],
